WEBVTT

00:13:58.556 --> 00:14:00.506
how are they taking off,

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:05.680
another is, how's AI being used
to assist brand-new applications?

00:14:05.704 --> 00:14:07.506
And there are a lot of both.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:10.674
So in terms of the AI applications,

00:14:10.698 --> 00:14:13.699
the instant translator
that you talked about --

00:14:13.723 --> 00:14:17.206
I think the Chinese companies
are doing a much better job

00:14:17.230 --> 00:14:23.572
building very high-quality translators
between Chinese and English and so on.

00:14:23.958 --> 00:14:29.371
I also think if we look
at face recognition as a technology,

00:14:29.395 --> 00:14:34.195
it's being deployed
in many more places in China,